<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/20/eng@/~part_IV__cl_22__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "If the Rukun Tetangga Area Committees of two or more Areas consider that in the combination of their activities it is necessary for all or any of the Rukun Tetangga Area Committees or Voluntary Patrolling Scheme members whilst carrying out patrol duty or guard duty, to perform functions or duties within an Area or Areas other than their own respective Area, it shall be lawful for them to do so subject to the written directions given by the Director. Employee not to suffer loss of remuneration or any detriment"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/20/eng@> .
