<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/20/eng@/~part_IV__cl_23__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Subject to section 20, an employer shall not subject an employee to any loss of remuneration or any detriment whatsoever by reason of such employee having to perform any duties or comply with any directions under Part III."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/20/eng@> .
