<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/20/eng@/~part_IV__cl_23__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Any question as to any loss of remuneration incurred by an employee who falls within the definition under the First Schedule of the Employment Act 1955, Sabah Labour Ordinance or Sarawak Labour Ordinance or an employee not falling within the definition of that Act or that Ordinance whose wages per month exceed two thousand five hundred ringgit but do not exceed five thousand ringgit shall be decided by the Director General."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/20/eng@> .
