<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/20/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "A Director shall issue to each member of the Rukun Tetangga Area Committee and each member of the Voluntary Patrolling Scheme an identification card which shall be signed by the Director."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/20/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/20/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/20/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/20/eng@> .
