<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/20/eng@/~part_IV__cl_33__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "All designation of Areas, appointment of Rukun Tetangga Area Committees, approval of Voluntary Patrolling Schemes and appointment of members of Voluntary Patrolling Schemes made before the commencement of this Act shall continue under this Act and be subject to the provision of this Act as if the designation, appointment and approval had been made under this Act. Continuance of act and action"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/20/eng@> .
