<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/20/eng@/~part_IV__cl_34> <https://schema.org/text> "Any act done or action taken by the Director General or any Director prior to the commencement of this Act shall be deemed to have been done or taken, and may be accordingly continued by the Director General or Director, under this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2012/20/eng@> .
